Let $\theta = \angle CBA.$  Since $\angle DBC = 2 \theta,$ $\angle DBA = 3 \theta.$

[asy]
unitsize(1 cm);

pair A, B, C, D;

A = (0,0);
B = (5,0);
C = (0,1);
D = (0,37/11);

draw(A--B--D---cycle);
